    "profile_character": "Grapes Unleaded is dominated by a robust, gas-forward blend of β-caryophyllene and limonene, layered with the earthy, complex notes of rare selinadiene compounds. This combination delivers a bold, pungent aroma that perfectly complements its sweet Concord grape flavor. The heavy presence of these peppery and citrusy terpenes gives the chew a sharp, aromatic bite that lingers pleasantly.",
    "dominant_compounds": [
      {
        "name": "β-Caryophyllene",
        "share_percent": 15.11,
        "mg_per_serving": 3.02,
        "researched_for": "Researchers are fascinated by its ability to bind directly to the body's CB2 receptors, and are exploring whether it may support healthy inflammatory responses and neuroprotection (Oxford level 1b, individual randomised trial)."
      },
      {
        "name": "Limonene",
        "share_percent": 13.84,
        "mg_per_serving": 2.77,
        "researched_for": "Widely studied for its broad biological activity, early work points toward limonene supporting cellular health and acting as a natural antioxidant (Oxford level 2b, human observational)."
