        "share_percent": 8.12,
        "mg_per_serving": 1.62,
        "researched_for": "Scientists are drawn to this complex botanical volatile to understand how it might support healthy inflammatory responses and protect cells from oxidative stress (Oxford level 2b, human observational)."
